Use in this repository
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Rummi Poker Grid contains a Dart port of the line-breaking core of semantic-wrap
version 0.4.0, and a copy of the Korean phrase model weights from the
@semantic-wrap/ko package of the same version.

  Upstream: https://github.com/woohyun-park/semantic-wrap
  Ported files:
    lib/utils/semantic_wrap/semantic_wrap.dart   (port of @semantic-wrap/core)
    lib/utils/semantic_wrap/ko_title_model.dart  (weights from @semantic-wrap/ko)

Both files carry the attribution in their header. The port keeps the space
boundary path the Korean preset uses and leaves out the paths that preset never
reaches; docs/core/I18N.md lists what was left out and why.

The Korean model is described by its authors as experimental, trained on 100
Korean article titles. It never predicts a boundary inside a Korean word.
